  <MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.PurgeDirective.Communication.Communication.Response.PurgeCredits>肃清[[PAUSE]]//征服[[PAUSE]]//扩张\n\n肃清额度是对本地节点执行成果的量化记录。\n\n消灭智慧有机体，[[PAUSE]]清除机械巢认定的敌对据点，[[PAUSE]]协助机械巢节点建立与扩张。\n\n完成已授权指令，[[PAUSE]]相应额度将被计入当前节点。</MAP_MechanoidMechanitor.PurgeDirective.Communication.Communication.Response.PurgeCredits>

